      </h2>
      <p>
        <strong>GOODYGUYS Custom Apparel &amp; Laser Studio</strong> ("GOODYGUYS", "we", "our", or "us") operates the website <a href="https://goodyguys-custom.netlify.app" style="color: #ff3366;">goodyguys-custom.netlify.app</a>. We provide on-demand custom t-shirts, personalized mugs, gaming mousepads, and precision laser-cut optical acrylic products.
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Official Contact Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:goodyguys.support@gmail.com" style="color: #60a5fa;">goodyguys.support@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Workshop Helpline / WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="tel:+919036969700" style="color: #60a5fa;">+91 9036969700</a> / <a href="tel:+919150053005" style="color: #60a5fa;">+91 9150053005</a></li>
