      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        2. What Information We Collect &amp; Why
      </h2>
      <p>We collect and process the following categories of information only when you voluntarily provide it:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Account &amp; Identity Data:</strong> Your name, email address, contact phone/WhatsApp number, and securely salted PBKDF2 password hash (passwords are never saved in plain text).</li>
        <li><strong>Campus Delivery Data:</strong> Hostel name, room number, department/block, and campus pincode (600119) to ensure accurate in-person delivery.</li>
        <li><strong>Custom Artwork &amp; Personalization Data:</strong> Custom engraved names, quotes, dates, uploaded photos (couple photos, pet portraits, artwork vectors), and dimensional selections required by our CNC laser and sublimation machinery.</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Verification Data:</strong> Selected payment method (COD or UPI), 12-digit UPI UTR reference ID, and uploaded payment proof screenshots used solely by our accounts desk to verify bank credit. We do <em>not</em> store bank account passwords, UPI PINs, or debit/credit card numbers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        3. Zero Third-Party Advertising Trackers
      </h2>
      <p>
        We strongly respect your digital privacy:
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li>We run <strong>ZERO advertising pixels</strong> (no Facebook/Meta Pixel, no Google Ads remarketing tags, no TikTok trackers).</li>
        <li>We set only <strong>strictly necessary, signed session cookies</strong> (`session`, `session.sig`) to remember your customized shopping bag, session security, and account authentication.</li>
        <li>No user profiling, behavioral surveillance, or cross-site tracking is ever performed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        4. Third-Party Infrastructure Services &amp; Processors
      </h2>
      <p>To securely host and deliver the GOODYGUYS experience, we partner with industry-leading infrastructure providers under strict confidentiality agreements:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Google Cloud Firestore (Database):</strong> Encrypted database service under project <code>goodyguys-5cdf8</code> registered to <code>goodyguys.support@gmail.com</code> for storing verified orders, account profiles, and idea submissions. Data is encrypted at rest using AES-256.</li>
        <li><strong>Netlify (Hosting &amp; Edge Delivery):</strong> Global CDN and serverless runtime enforcing end-to-end TLS 1.3 encryption across all network transfers.</li>
        <li><strong>QRServer:</strong> Used exclusively to render static NPCI standard UPI QR codes dynamically in the browser based on the exact checkout order total. No personal identifiers or banking passwords are sent.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        5. Data Security &amp; Encryption Standards
      </h2>
      <p>We deploy defensive cybersecurity controls across all layers of GOODYGUYS:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Transport Encryption:</strong> 100% of network traffic uses HTTPS (TLS 1.2/1.3) with HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) headers.</li>
        <li><strong>Cryptographic Password Protection:</strong> Account passwords are protected using the native <code>PBKDF2</code> algorithm with 10,000 iterations and unique 128-bit cryptographic salts. Plaintext passwords never touch our database.</li>
        <li><strong>File Security &amp; Strict MIME Validation:</strong> Uploaded custom graphics are validated against authorized MIME formats (JPEG, PNG, WEBP, GIF) and stored with randomized alphanumeric slugs to prevent directory traversal or file-inclusion attacks.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        6. Your Rights: Data Download &amp; Account Deletion
      </h2>
      <p>In adherence to pre-launch transparency guidelines and data protection standards, you have the right to control your personal data at all times:</p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li><strong>Right to Download (Data Portability):</strong> You can download a complete JSON archive of your account profile, order history, and saved artwork directly from your <a href="/account" style="color: #ff3366; font-weight: 700;">Customer Account Portal</a> or by writing to <a href="mailto:goodyguys.support@gmail.com" style="color: #60a5fa;">goodyguys.support@gmail.com</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Erasure (Account Deletion):</strong> You can request full erasure of your account, contact details, and uploaded artwork via the deletion tool in your account settings or by messaging our support helpline on WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/919036969700" style="color: #4ade80;">+91 9036969700</a>. Deletion is completed within 48 business hours.</li>
        <li><strong>Artwork Retention:</strong> Customer-uploaded photos are retained for 30 calendar days following successful delivery to accommodate warranty remakes or reorders, after which raw artwork files are securely purged.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        7. Student &amp; Minor Advisory
      </h2>
      <p>
        Our services are primarily tailored for university students, creators, and faculty. Individuals under 18 years of age should use this service with the knowledge and supervision of a parent, hostel warden, or legal guardian, particularly when making digital UPI payments.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.35rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;">
        8. Security Incident Notification Protocol
      </h2>
